Package: fasttrop
Title: Fast Triply Robust Panel Estimators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Farach", email = "alexfarach@microsoft.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: The Triply Robust Panel (TROP) estimator of Athey, Imbens, Qu,
    and Viviano (2026) <doi:10.1002/jae.70061> gives the average treatment
    effect on the treated in panel data. The estimator adds unit weights, time
    weights, and a low-rank term with a nuclear-norm penalty to a two-way fixed
    effects model of untreated outcomes. This package has the local estimator
    of the paper and the global block estimator of the 'Python' package from
    the authors.
    It selects the tuning parameters with cross-validation and calculates
    standard errors with a unit bootstrap. The model fits run in C with
    'OpenMP' threads and with the 'BLAS' and 'LAPACK' libraries that R uses.
    The authors of the method did not write this package.
